 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Routing table (routing.config.ts)",
   "items": [
    "sed -i and awk with a redirect: block in every environment",
    "grep, rg: rtk grep if RTK is installed, jcodemunch search_text if the repo is indexed, else allow",
    "cat: the Read tool; find: jcodemunch get_file_tree if indexed, else allow",
    "fd, docker and every other command: allow"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "What the code does not do",
   "items": [
    "No hook script ships; you write the PreToolUse hook on the Bash tool",
    "The environment cache lives in process memory for 30 minutes; a hook starts fresh per call, so write detection to a file",
    "String matching misses sed -E -i, perl -pi and commands built at runtime; docker is allowed unchecked"
   ]
  }
 ]
